        "headline": "Red Flag Warning issued June 25 at 8:58AM AKDT until June 26 at 12:00AM AKDT by NWS Fairbanks AK",
        "description": "The National Weather Service in Fairbanks has issued a Red Flag\nWarning for lightning, which is in effect from noon today to\nmidnight AKDT Friday morning.\n\n* AFFECTED AREA...Upper Koyukuk Valley.\n\n* TIMING...From 12 PM Thursday to 12 AM Friday.\n\n* THUNDERSTORM COVERAGE INDEX...Scattered\n\n* WINDS...West 5 to 10 mph.\n\n* HUMIDITY...As low as 28 percent.\n\n* TEMPERATURES...Highs in the low to mid 80s.\n\n* IMPACTS...Critical fire weather conditions are expected due to\nscattered thunderstorms. Thunderst",
        "severity": "Severe",
        "certainty": "Likely",
        "urgency": "Expected",
        "sender": "NWS Fairbanks AK",
        "effective": "2026-06-25T08:58:00-08:00",
        "expires": "2026-06-26T00:00:00-08:00",
        "areas": "Upper Koyukuk Valley",
        "category": "Met",
        "response": "Prepare",
        "instruction": "A Red Flag Warning means that conditions are occurring or will\noccur which could lead to the development of large and dangerous\nfires. It is directed toward fire agencies, and through them, to\nthe public.\n\nPlease advise the appropriate officials or fire crews in the\nfield of this Red Flag Warning.",
        "lat": null,
        "lng": null
      },
